<view class="page"><view class="page-masthead"><image class="masthead-icon" src="/assets/icons/shop.png"/><view class="masthead-copy"><view class="page-title">商家入驻申请</view><view class="masthead-subtitle">管理服务，回应邻里所需</view></view></view><view class="card">审核通过后，商家详情会公示营业执照名称和统一社会信用代码。</view><view class="card"><input class="ui-input" placeholder="商家名称" data-field="name" value="{{name}}" bindinput="input"/><picker range="{{categories}}" value="{{categoryIndex}}" bindchange="chooseCategory"><view class="picker">类别：{{categories[categoryIndex]}}</view></picker><input class="ui-input" placeholder="营业执照名称" data-field="licenseName" value="{{licenseName}}" bindinput="input"/><input class="ui-input" placeholder="统一社会信用代码（18 位）" data-field="creditCode" value="{{creditCode}}" bindinput="input"/><button bindtap="upload">{{licenseFileId ? '已上传营业执照，点击重选' : '拍摄/上传营业执照'}}</button><input class="ui-input" placeholder="联系人" data-field="contactName" value="{{contactName}}" bindinput="input"/><input class="ui-input" type="number" placeholder="联系电话" data-field="phone" value="{{phone}}" bindinput="input"/><view wx:if="{{existing}}" class="muted">当前状态：{{existing.status}} {{existing.reviewNote}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><button type="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="submit">提交审核</button></view>
